<BaseLayout title="About — Alex Franquelli" description="About Alex Franquelli, writer and media professional based in Rome.">
  <div class="simple">
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>Alex Franquelli</h1>
    <p>I am a writer and media professional based in Rome. I have written about music, politics and culture for publications including The Quietus, PopMatters, All About Jazz, The Line of Best Fit, openDemocracy and OndaRock.</p>
    <p>This site is an independent archive of reviews, interviews, live reports and longer features in English and Italian, stretching back to the mid-2000s and continuing as recovered work is added.</p>
    <p>Alongside writing, I am Director of Client Growth at The Posterhouse. I also write fiction and am finishing my first novel.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
